@Product.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5018
@Keycloak_HostAddress = http://localhost:8080

# User login (authorization_code + PKCE): run the API, open {{Product.API_HostAddress}}/swagger,
# click "Authorize" -> "oidc" -> log in as demo / demo. Swagger UI handles code_verifier/code_challenge.

### Get an access token via client_credentials (scopes: products.read products.write)
# @name token
POST {{Keycloak_HostAddress}}/realms/ecommerce/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=client_credentials&client_id=ecommerce-client&client_secret=ecommerce-client-secret

###
@accessToken = {{token.response.body.access_token}}

### List products (requires products.read scope)
GET {{Product.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/products
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

###
